/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 69 0 R
/T (To design a relational data model and build the corresponding online forms for a business Event Registration application using Zoho Creator, a low-code application development platform, and to verify that the deployed forms correctly capture, validate, and store participant, event, and session information.)
/E (To design a relational data model and build the corresponding online forms for a business Event Registration application using Zoho Creator, a low-code application development platform, and to verify that the deployed forms correctly capture, validate, and store participant, event, and session information.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 69 0 R
/T (The application was built in Zoho Creator by first setting up a blank application workspace, then designing the registration form with suitable field types, adding validation and mandatory rules, deploying the form as a live application, testing it with sample data, and finally verifying the stored records in the underlying database. The overall data model connecting all forms was then documented as an Entity-Relationship \(ER\) diagram. Each step is described below with its corresponding screenshot.)
/E (The application was built in Zoho Creator by first setting up a blank application workspace, then designing the registration form with suitable field types, adding validation and mandatory rules, deploying the form as a live application, testing it with sample data, and finally verifying the stored records in the underlying database. The overall data model connecting all forms was then documented as an Entity-Relationship \(ER\) diagram. Each step is described below with its corresponding screenshot.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
