/P 69 0 R
/T (The registration form was built field-by-field, matching each field type to the kind of data expected: Participant Name used First/Last Name sub-fields, Participant Type used Radio buttons \(Student / Faculty / Professional\), Team Size used a Number field, Email Address and Contact Number captured communication details, College/Organization Name used a Single Line field, and Institution Address used a Multi-line field.)
/E (The registration form was built field-by-field, matching each field type to the kind of data expected: Participant Name used First/Last Name sub-fields, Participant Type used Radio buttons \(Student / Faculty / Professional\), Team Size used a Number field, Email Address and Contact Number captured communication details, College/Organization Name used a Single Line field, and Institution Address used a Multi-line field.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
